            <title>[LU-20875] False ENOMEM during OST reconnect</title>
                <link>https://jira.whamcloud.com/browse/LU-20875</link>
                <project id="10000" key="LU">Lustre</project>
                    <description>&lt;p&gt;OST might reconfigured with less BRW size between reconnects. It caused situation when client had extents with BRW size 16Mb, while new config accespt just a 4Mb.&lt;br/&gt;
This situation caused a false ENOMEM in preparing osc extent in sending, due incorrect check for 64k pages clients interoperability.&lt;br/&gt;
Lets remove this check.&lt;/p&gt;</description>
